  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under AU-C Section 800, contractual basis and regulatory basis are distinct frameworks. When the loan agreement incorporates regulatory rules plus additional reporting requirements (off-balance-sheet commitments), the combined obligations cannot be satisfied by a single set of statements. Each user requires statements under its respective framework.
Wrong (A): The regulatory basis covers only the commission''s rules. Adding contractual requirements creates a different framework that cannot be labeled purely regulatory.
