  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under SFAC No. 8, the FASB excluded conservatism from qualitative characteristics, reasoning that asymmetric treatment conflicts with neutrality. The IASB, in its 2018 revised Conceptual Framework, reintroduced prudence as the exercise of caution under uncertainty, positioning it as supporting rather than conflicting with neutrality.
